WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A vulnerability observation records a potential weakness associated with a device or software.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Examine the affected records, recorded CVE details and the source that reported the observation.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A recorded finding is not proof that a weakness is exploitable or has been exploited.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Trace D3 to System B, Mission service A and Business service B. Validate the evidence and service relevance before deciding on action.
